d by people at some of the biggest and best companies in the world, which is absolutely crazy to me.\n\nWhen I started the magazine a couple of months ago, I wanted to build a place for all things design engineering where I could write about and share everything I know and continue to learn. My goal was to reach at least 500 subscribers.\n\nThe impact Interfaces has had is beyond anything I expected. I’ve received messages from subscribers who got their first design engineering roles, in part thanks to Interfaces.\n\nTo celebrate this milestone, you can use the code INTERFACES50 to get 50% off your subscription for the next 3 months. It’s available to the first 100 people who use it.\n\nThere’s some very exciting stuff coming soon to Interfaces that I can’t wait to share.","created_at":"Tue Oct 06 14:55:32 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1791298532,"likes":377,"reposts":9,"replies":18,"quotes":1,"bookmarks":246,"views":15278,"is_note_tweet":true,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":2048,"height":1152,"duration":68.266,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2107482262195314689/vid/avc1/2048x1152/A7IsCqMzyxG_UxYm.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107482262195314689/img/2MV2d5mUlFCza2hW.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2107484912638886083","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2107484912638886083","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"https://interfaces.dev/","created_at":"Tue Oct 06 14:55:33 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1791298533,"likes":13,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":14,"views":1868,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":{"screen_name":"jakubkrehel","status":"2107484910877315355"},"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2105687834904457455","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2105687834904457455","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"Worked on our new Security page with this great hero section designed by @paulfaivret.\n\nTo make the text feel like it sits behind the shield, we used two identical copies of the heading stacked on top of each other.\n\nOne is blurred, the other isn't and they have opposite masks. There’s also a subtle dark tint where they overlap.","created_at":"Thu Oct 01 15:54:36 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790870076,"likes":188,"reposts":3,"replies":15,"quotes":3,"bookmarks":106,"views":12618,"is_note_tweet":true,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":3124,"height":2016,"duration":9.416,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2105684838619451393/vid/avc1/3124x2016/4m5EvL_FBPnmrQkJ.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2105684838619451393/img/dKdfQsLOeJJL5q8V.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2105687836787699846","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2105687836787699846","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"The effect also persists while the text is animating in.","created_at":"Thu Oct 01 15:54:36 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790870076,"likes":12,"reposts":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":5,"views":1994,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":{"screen_name":"jakubkrehel","status":"2105687834904457455"},"quote":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":3124,"height":2016,"duration":5,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2105682260867358720/vid/avc1/3124x2016/imDDTzDG5QubiqIW.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2105682260867358720/img/NMmQA6Vy9xdCDFAO.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2105687839161872671","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2105687839161872671","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"You can see the page live here. All of the security data is live too, so as soon as anything changes, it updates without us having to do it manually.\n\nhttps://interfere.com/security","created_at":"Thu Oct 01 15:54:37 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790870077,"likes":7,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"quotes