ll},{"id":"2102424781970690480","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2102424781970690480","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"https://github.com/jakubkrehel/loading","created_at":"Tue Sep 22 15:48:23 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790092103,"likes":11,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":6,"views":3585,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":{"screen_name":"jakubkrehel","status":"2102422222967095544"},"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2102075328218742845","url":"https://x.com/interfere_/status/2102075328218742845","author_handle":"interfere_","reposted":true,"text":"Introducing the Users overview.\n\nSee which users are affected by problems and explore their activity and sessions. Add custom attributes like ARR or subscription tier for better prioritization.\n\nWorks for both identified and anonymous users.\n\nLive now.\n\nhttps://interfere.com/changelog/users","created_at":"Mon Sep 21 16:39:47 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790008787,"likes":45,"reposts":5,"replies":2,"quotes":1,"bookmarks":30,"views":6771,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":true},{"id":"2100605819238621632","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2100605819238621632","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"I added an example to every item in the Interface Cheat Sheet so it’s easier to understand each point.\n\nThe cheat sheet is a mix of best practices and some of my personal preferences that I like using to make stuff feel better on the web.\n\nhttps://interfaces.dev/cheat-sheet","created_at":"Thu Sep 17 15:20:29 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1789658429,"likes":1145,"reposts":74,"replies":27,"quotes":12,"bookmarks":1875,"views":94234,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2099514159826096310","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2099514159826096310","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"The Invisible Side of Design Engineering\nhttps://jakub.kr/writing/the-invisible-side-of-design-engineering","created_at":"Mon Sep 14 15:02:37 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1789398157,"likes":730,"reposts":44,"replies":21,"quotes":6,"bookmarks":781,"views":31958,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2098083072843432255","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2098083072843432255","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"Built this morphing dialog for giving the Interfere agent feedback. \n\nIt follows a lot of the principles from an Interfaces issue I wrote a while back about how to build a dialog like this.","created_at":"Thu Sep 10 16:15:59 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1789056959,"likes":488,"reposts":10,"replies":13,"quotes":2,"bookmarks":395,"views":21580,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":2324,"height":2040,"duration":8.546,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2098082030323998729/vid/avc1/2324x2040/egXG_yC3s9l5N0xm.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2098082030323998729/img/MkcGINFO1J6zwI1f.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2098083638659207576","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2098083638659207576","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"You can read the issue below https://interfaces.dev/","created_at":"Thu Sep 10 16:18:14 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1789057094,"likes":12,"reposts":0,"replies":1,"quotes":1,"bookmarks":12,"views":2389,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":{"screen_name":"jakubkrehel","status":"2098083072843432255"},"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2095536111804150211","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2095536111804150211","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"It’s incredible that my skills have been installed more than 160,000 times.  \n\nI originally built them for myself. I had a pretty good idea of how I wanted to do certain things, but whenever I hopped between projects, I had to explain them over and over again.  \n\nSkills often get a bad rap, and it’s understandable because there are a lot that are complete slop.  \n\nBut there are also some that are genuinely useful, help you do things better and let you learn from them.  \n\nThat’s the kind I try to build.","created_at":"Thu Sep 03 15:35:16 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1788449716,"likes":3921,"reposts":207,"replies":44,"quotes":7,"bookmarks":5030,"views":220800,"is_note_tweet":true,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":2424,"height":1604,"duration":48.366,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2095535923853197312/vid/avc1/2424x1604/sKSt1Nn-X3yJbRO6.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2095535923853197312/img/ROThN2s8FJHHuU1P.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2095536183623193076","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2095536183623193076","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"https://github.com/jakubkrehel/skills","created_at":"Thu Sep 03 15:35:34 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1788449734,"likes":173,"reposts":15,"replies":4,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":466,"views":19634,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":{"screen_name":"jakubkrehel","status":"2095536111804150211"},"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2095538355165344214","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2095538355165344214","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"https://github.com/jakubkrehel/make-interfaces-feel-better","created_at":"Thu Sep 03 15:44:11 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1788450251,"likes":102,"reposts":3,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":226,"views":14089,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":{"screen_name":"jakubkrehel","status":"2095536183623193076"},"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2094821172495987130","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2094821172495987130","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"We launched our blog and wrote about the thinking behind the visual identity, graphics and animations on our new website with @paulfaivret. \n\nLet us know if you enjoy posts like these and we'll try to do more of them!","created_at":"Tue Sep 01 16:14:22 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1788279262,"likes":131,"reposts":6,"replies":8,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":85,"views":12980,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":null,"quote":{"id":"2094818571285082491","text":"How we built Interfere's new website\n\nIn our first blog post, our Head of Design @paulfaivret  and Design Engineer @jakubkrehel discuss the thought process behind the visual identity, graphics and animations on our new website.\n\nhttps://interfere.com/blog/how-we-built-interferes-new-website","author":"interfere_","media_n":0},"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":2896,"height":1944,"duration":9.25,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2094821012403564544/vid/avc1/2896x1944/b3HYfZXRdAxUOaNh.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2094821012403564544/img/sYNExrYAsJ-hXtde.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2094443593951797265","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2094443593951797265","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"Introducing the first Interfaces guest issue:\n\n4 Principles of Transition by @Jakubantalik\n\nEvery now and then, I’ll invite people whose work I enjoy to write about a topic they care about.\n\nThis month, Jakub goes in-depth on transitions.\n\nNow live on https://interfaces.dev/!","created_at":"Mon Aug 31 15:14:00 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1788189240,"likes":342,"reposts":6,"replies":16,"quotes":1,"bookmarks":239,"views":19302,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":2128,"height":1330,"duration":31.016,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2094440261766057985/vid/avc1/2128x1330/woP01MvWvsw7lkoR.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2094440261766057985/img/VmVB0eXuI06AIaTy.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2094443596493574303","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2094443596493574303","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"There’s also a small surprise waiting for every Interfaces subscriber at the end of the issue :)","created_at":"Mon Aug 31 15:14:00 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1788189240,"likes":7,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":3,"views":3285,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":{"screen_name":"jakubkrehel","status":"2094443593951797265"},"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2092631258857664732","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2092631258857664732","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"Very happy with this reveal interaction for an upcoming blog post we're working on with @paulfaivret.\n\nIt's two assets stacked on top of each other. The wireframe is underneath and the actual design is on top.\n\nThe top asset is masked, so it only shows through a circle that follows your cursor. Clicking expands the circle until it fills the frame and then the mask inverts.","created_at":"Wed Aug 26 15:12:25 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1787757145,"likes":256,"reposts":7,"replies":13,"quotes":2,"bookmarks":128,"views":23245,"is_note_tweet":true,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":2604,"height":1628,"duration":13.746,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2092626279405096960/vid/avc1/2604x1628/ddZU_5VFFzowacd7.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2092626279405096960/img/AKh8UDofgPujpmq_.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2092323505387745540","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2092323505387745540","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"I added 2 new skills to the collection.\n\n/break\n\nIt renders a component you choose in every state and scenario on a temporary page and stress tests it.\n\nIt’s a great way to find issues in your design 