re’s homepage is a simple staggered animation. \n\nEach timeline item animates opacity, blur and translateY and the lines animate scaleY.\n\nThe trickiest part was getting the timing right so the flow between the items feels natural.","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 15:51:28 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1785945088,"likes":354,"reposts":13,"replies":7,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":275,"views":14963,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":3076,"height":2016,"duration":16.765,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2085030144582762496/vid/avc1/3076x2016/AApKOd9-N5yzk02I.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2085030144582762496/img/UGwVRxHL2FLoLk88.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2085030942465274136","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2085030942465274136","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"You can see it live on https://interfere.com/","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 15:51:29 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1785945089,"likes":9,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":11,"views":2090,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":{"screen_name":"jakubkrehel","status":"2085030940577820747"},"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2083958546215956480","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2083958546215956480","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"One of my favorite features I've added to Interfaces recently is the ⌘K menu. You can search for anything in any issue from anywhere.\n\nBuilt with cmdk, Fuse.js and Base UI.","created_at":"Sun Aug 02 16:50:10 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1785689410,"likes":727,"reposts":14,"replies":13,"quotes":3,"bookmarks":710,"views":36954,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":3000,"height":1780,"duration":15.251,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2083958280045408258/vid/avc1/3000x1780/tu8MTavFYKwC_xG_.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2083958280045408258/img/xc_O2GaHsPsXO65q.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2083958661177544909","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2083958661177544909","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"https://interfaces.dev/","created_at":"Sun Aug 02 16:50:37 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1785689437,"likes":15,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":20,"views":3511,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":{"screen_name":"jakubkrehel","status":"2083958546215956480"},"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2082127924946223448","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2082127924946223448","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"A couple of before / after examples of the skills I've added last week.","created_at":"Tue Jul 28 15:35:56 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1785252956,"likes":4517,"reposts":162,"replies":27,"quotes":11,"bookmarks":5290,"views":586534,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":null,"quote":{"id":"2080683435153117488","text":"I’ve added 4 new skills to the /better collection.\n\n/better-accessibility\nFinds accessibility issues and helps fix them.\n\n/better-layout\nImproves layout, spacing, hierarchy and responsiveness.\n\n/better-writing\nMakes product copy clearer, more concise and consistent.\n\n/better-interface\nBrings all the new and existing skills together to review and improve whatever you’re working on as a whole.\n\nThere are now 7 skills in total and the collection keeps growing to cover more and more areas.\n\nnpx skills add jakubkrehel/skills\n\nhttps://github.com/jakubkrehel/skills","author":"jakubkrehel","media_n":0},"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":2424,"height":1604,"duration":23.666,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082127446485221376/vid/avc1/2424x1604/_uykgsOcqosf6lBn.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2082127446485221376/img/4grHbG79Xx_7yhjw.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2082138382268826054","url":"https:/