more concise and consistent.\n\n/better-interface\nBrings all the new and existing skills together to review and improve whatever you’re working on as a whole.\n\nThere are now 7 skills in total and the collection keeps growing to cover more and more areas.\n\nnpx skills add jakubkrehel/skills\n\nhttps://github.com/jakubkrehel/skills","created_at":"Fri Jul 24 15:56:02 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1784908562,"likes":2294,"reposts":114,"replies":31,"quotes":9,"bookmarks":4447,"views":674509,"is_note_tweet":true,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2079956496318669289","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2079956496318669289","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"Some stuff I built at Interfere in the past 8 months","created_at":"Wed Jul 22 15:47:27 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1784735247,"likes":504,"reposts":13,"replies":15,"quotes":6,"bookmarks":368,"views":41281,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":3052,"height":1918,"duration":48.2,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2079956237362282496/vid/avc1/3052x1918/X9sCOVmmWw2Qh_J5.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2079956237362282496/img/ab5PkgsRXF7u5hux.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2078867292004216970","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2078867292004216970","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"The Interfaces platform itself is an example of what you can learn in the magazine. I spend about as much time working on it as I do on the content.\n\nA few updates from the past couple of weeks include:\n\n→ updated landing page\n→ ⌘K menu + search across all issues\n→ design refresh across the board\n→ lifetime plan\n\nplus a bunch of smaller improvements.","created_at":"Sun Jul 19 15:39:20 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1784475560,"likes":463,"reposts":8,"replies":8,"quotes":3,"bookmarks":399,"views":29558,"is_note_tweet":true,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":2928,"height":1764,"duration":34.416,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2078866035864752128/vid/avc1/2928x1764/FcMgzwTZvhnZBRsb.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2078866035864752128/img/wZ0P5-DjgHkqvA22.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2078867549471519146","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2078867549471519146","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"https://interfaces.dev/","created_at":"Sun Jul 19 15:40:21 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1784475621,"likes":17,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":23,"views":3142,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":{"screen_name":"jakubkrehel","status":"2078867292004216970"},"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2077414318597869956","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2077414318597869956","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"A couple of examples before and after using /better-typography and /better-ui.","created_at":"Wed Jul 15 15:25:44 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1784129144,"likes":1546,"reposts":40,"replies":21,"quotes":2,"bookmarks":2016,"views":129527,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":null,"quote":{"id":"2076328529604612467","text":"In a recent article, I wrote about using skills to encode judgement and understanding into agents.\n\nI put together a set of skills that each focus on a different part of a product and help make it better.\n\n/better-ui\n/better-typography\n/better-colors\n\nMore skills are coming soon.\n\nnpx skills add jakubkrehel/skills","author":"jakubkrehel","media_n":1},"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":2384,"height":1624,"duration":23.341,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2077414025084694528/vid/avc1/2384x1624/wybnVWFqXbJ56ydf.mp4?tag=28","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2077414025084694528/img/B7Ilvm3wlBoOGo5L.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2077039409896030680","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2077039409896030680","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"On iOS, focusing an input with text smaller than 16px zooms the whole page in.\n\nThis is an accessibility feature. When the text is smaller than 16px, WebKit scales the page up to make it easier to read while typing.\n\nSometimes you don't want this behavior and you may have noticed that some websites disable it.\n\nThere are two common workarounds.\n\nThe first is to use media queries and set inputs and textareas to a 16px font size on mobile.\n\nThe second is to add `maximum-scale=1` to the viewport `<meta>` tag. The page cannot scale beyond `1`, so the automatic zoom never happens.\n\nPinch zoom still works in WebKit-based browsers on iOS because they ignore the limit for manual zooming. Other browsers may respect it, which can prevent users from zooming and create an accessibility issue.\n\nI rarely override default accessibility behavior, but this is one of the cases where I do. I use the <meta> tag approach for temporary surfaces like a login page and use media queries everywhere else.","created_at":"Tue Jul 14 14:35:59 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1784039759,"likes":314,"reposts":10,"replies":12,"quotes":3,"bookmarks":267,"views":20922,"is_note_tweet":true,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"video","width":1064,"height":1946,"duration":9.033,"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2077039096443052032/vid/avc1/1064x1946/mSeHiSD6FBlq8Sm-.mp4?tag=28","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2077039096443052032/img/ARMA9H7r8nHGw65B.jpg"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2076328529604612467","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2076328529604612467","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"In a recent article, I wrote about using skills to encode judgement and understanding into agents.\n\nI put together a set of skills that each focus on a different part of a product and help make it better.\n\n/better-ui\n/better-typography\n/better-colors\n\nMore skills are coming soon.\n\nnpx skills add jakubkrehel/skills","created_at":"Sun Jul 12 15:31:12 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1783870272,"likes":2896,"reposts":127,"replies":44,"quotes":6,"bookmarks":4216,"views":240383,"is_note_tweet":true,"replying_to":null,"quote":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"photo","width":4096,"height":2150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNCZEw4W4AErWgl.jpg?name=orig"}]},"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2076328533467558340","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2076328533467558340","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"https://github.com/jakubkrehel/skills","created_at":"Sun Jul 12 15:31:13 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1783870273,"likes":144,"reposts":6,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":258,"views":15505,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":{"screen_name":"jakubkrehel","status":"2076328529604612467"},"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null},{"id":"2076328536365769090","url":"https://x.com/jakubkrehel/status/2076328536365769090","author_handle":"jakubkrehel","reposted":false,"text":"If you want to learn more about the topics covered by these skills, you can subscribe to Interfaces below.\n\nIt covers all of them in depth and much more.\n\nhttps://interfaces.dev/","created_at":"Sun Jul 12 15:31:14 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1783870274,"likes":57,"reposts":1,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":65,"views":11613,"is_note_tweet":false,"replying_to":{"screen_name":"jakubkrehel","status":"2076328533467558340"},"quote":null,"media":null,"reposted_by":null}],"source":"api.fxtwitter.com/2/profile/<handle>/statuses (public FixTweet API; no login), fetched 2026-10-12T18:35:18.805Z"}